        <ARI_Version>2</ARI_Version>
        <rdfs:comment>Alopecia areata is a type of hair loss that occurs when your immune system mistakenly attacks hair follicles, which is where hair growth begins. The damage to the follicle is usually not permanent. Experts do not know why the immune system attacks the follicles.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Alopecia areata</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


