        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Ankylosing Spondylitis, Axial - Affects the spine and sacroiliac joints.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Ankylosing Spondylitis, Peripheral - Involves joints outside the spine, like knees or hips.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
