        <ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>autoimmune hemolytic anemia | broader | AIHA is the parent; cold agglutinin disease is its cold-antibody subtype (warm AIHA is the other main type)</ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>
        <ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>autoimmune hemolytic anemia, cold type | broader | cold-type AIHA (MONDO:0016450) also covers paroxysmal cold haemoglobinuria and mixed-type; broader than cold agglutinin disease proper</ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>
        <ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>cAHA | broader | cold-type AIHA (MONDO:0016450, an ancestor of CAD) also covers secondary cold agglutinin syndrome and paroxysmal cold haemoglobinuria</ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>
