        <ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>inflammatory bowel disease 1 | subtype | IBD1 (MONDO:0009960), the NOD2 genetic susceptibility form; its synonym &apos;Crohn disease-associated growth failure&apos; was withdrawn 2026-09-07</ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>
        <ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>inflammatory bowel disease 1, Crohn disease | subtype | IBD1 (MONDO:0009960), the NOD2 genetic susceptibility form; its synonym &apos;Crohn disease-associated growth failure&apos; was withdrawn 2026-09-07</ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>
        <ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>inflammatory bowel disease caused by mutation in NOD2 | subtype | IBD1 (MONDO:0009960), the NOD2 genetic susceptibility form; its synonym &apos;Crohn disease-associated growth failure&apos; was withdrawn 2026-09-07</ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>
