        <ARI_RefLink>Erythema Nodosum: Support Group | https://www.facebook.com/groups/618816731634522/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>For People who have Erythema Nodosum | https://www.facebook.com/groups/44877696003/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Cleveland Clinic | https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/24565-erythema-nodosum</ARI_RefLink>
