        <ARI_RefLink>American Thyroid Association | https://www.thyroid.org/graves-disease/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Graves&apos; Disease and Thyroid Foundation | https://www.gdatf.org/</ARI_RefLink>
