        <ARI_DefSource>Martinez-Agredano 2016; https://n.neurology.org/content/78/1_Supplement/P06.148; Sejvar 2011; https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC5703046/</ARI_DefSource>
