        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Healthline | https://www.healthline.com/health/guillain-barre-syndrome</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>The Brave Chick | https://thebravechicksite.wordpress.com/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>The Gimpy Girl Who Could | http://thegimpygirlwhocould.blogspot.com/</ARI_RefLink>
