        <ARI_RefLink>International Pemphigus &amp; Pemphigoid Foundation | https://www.pemphigus.org/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Healthline | https://www.healthline.com/health/pregnancy/what-causes-rashes-during-pregnancy-and-how-to-treat-them#herpes-gestationis</ARI_RefLink>
