        <ARI_RefLink>Hidradenitis Suppurativa Foundation | https://www.hs-foundation.org/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Hope for HS | http://www.hopeforhs.org/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Cleveland Clinic | https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/17716-hidradenitis-suppurativa</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Healthline | https://www.healthline.com/health/hidradenitis-suppurativa</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Mayo Clinic | https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/hidradenitis-suppurativa/symptoms-causes/syc-20352306</ARI_RefLink>
