        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Cleveland Clinic | https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/13285-microscopic-polyangiitis-mpa</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Microscopic Polyangiitis at the Vasculitis Foundation | https://www.vasculitisfoundation.org/education/vasculitis-types/microscopic-polyangiitis/</ARI_RefLink>
