        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Balo Concentric Sclerosis, Classic - Rare variant of multiple sclerosis with concentric demyelination.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Multiple Sclerosis, Primary Progressive (PPMS) - Gradual worsening without relapses.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Multiple Sclerosis, Progressive-Relapsing (PRMS) - Rare, steady decline with relapses.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Multiple Sclerosis, Relapsing-Remitting (RRMS) - Most common form with flare-ups.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Multiple Sclerosis, Secondary Progressive (SPMS) - Follows RRMS with worsening symptoms.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_DOID>2377</ARI_DOID>
