        <ARI_Synonym>Brachial radiculitis</ARI_Synonym>
        <ARI_Synonym>Idiopathic brachial neuritis</ARI_Synonym>
        <ARI_Synonym>Idiopathic brachial plexus neuropathy</ARI_Synonym>
        <ARI_Synonym>Parsonage-Turner Syndrome</ARI_Synonym>
        <ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>Brachial neuropathy | broader | any brachial plexus lesion, including traumatic, compressive and neoplastic plexopathy (DOID:3690 is an ancestor)</ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>
