        <ARI_RefLink>Isaac’s Syndrome | https://www.facebook.com/groups/ISAACS.PNH/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Cleveland Clinic | https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/22665-isaacs-syndrome</ARI_RefLink>
