        <rdfs:comment>Paroxysmal nocturnal hemoglobinuria is a rare blood disorder caused when a protein is missing from a person&apos;s blood due to a mutation in a gene. Without the protein, the body&apos;s immune system attacks the red blood cells and breaks them apart.</rdfs:comment>
