        <ARI_Pubmed>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30892569/</ARI_Pubmed>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Cleveland Clinic | https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/23033-pemphigus-vulgaris</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Healthline | https://www.healthline.com/health/pemphigus-vulgaris</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>The International Pemphigus &amp; Pemphigoid Foundation | http://www.pemphigus.org/</ARI_RefLink>
