        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Cleveland Clinic | https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/polyarteritis-nodosa-pan</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Healthline | https://www.healthline.com/health/polyarteritis-nodosa</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>PAN - Polyarteritis Nodosa | https://www.facebook.com/groups/6799967156</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Vaculitis Foundation | https://www.vasculitisfoundation.org/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Vasculitis Foundation Canada | https://vasculitis.ca/</ARI_RefLink>
