        <ARI_Pubmed>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24388724/</ARI_Pubmed>
        <ARI_RefLink>Joni Ruth | http://justagirlwithspots.com/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Julie | http://www.itsjustabadday.com/</ARI_RefLink>
