        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Mayo Clinic | https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/rheumatoid-arthritis/symptoms-causes/syc-20353648</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Pollyanna Penguin’s RA Blog | https://pollyannapenguin.wordpress.com/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Rheumatoid Arthritis Foundation | https://www.helpfightra.org/</ARI_RefLink>
