        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Sarcoidosis, Cutaneous - Involves the skin with lupus pernio or erythema nodosum.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Sarcoidosis, Neurosarcoidosis - Affects the nervous system.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
