        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Scleritis, Anterior - Affects the front of the sclera.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Scleritis, Necrotizing - Severe, leading to scleral destruction.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Scleritis, Posterior - Involves the back of the sclera, causing vision loss.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
