        <rdfs:comment>Scleritis is an inflammation of the white tissue, the sclera, that surrounds most of the eye. Though scleritis is a symptom of a number of autoimmune diseases, it is suspected of being an autoimmune disease itself.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Scleritis</rdfs:label>
