        <ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>Sicca syndrome | broader | dry eyes + dry mouth from any cause (drugs, age, radiation, other diseases); the ARI definition itself says it is called Sjögren&apos;s disease only when autoimmune</ARI_SynonymWithdrawn>
