        <rdfs:comment>Sicca syndrome is marked by dry mouth and dry eyes. If these symptoms are caused by an autoimmune process, it is called Sjogren&apos;s disease. See Sjögrens disease for more information.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Sjögren&apos;s disease</rdfs:label>
