        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Healthline | https://www.healthline.com/health/systemic-lupus-erythematosus</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Mayo Clinic | https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/lupus/symptoms-causes/syc-20365789</ARI_RefLink>
